# Moogles in the Wild (otherAreas 102): every Mog House zone but Bastok Mines (the main flows'), each the same
# section table, each handler run there once. Three chars, one per nation (each with its nation's fame level for the
# quest and a bed placed 61 s ago, a GM), each inside the zone's Mog House (the zone's line to itself). In its home
# nation's zones: 30013 (section 1), option 1: begun; questSeen 0 (a GM): 30014, finished: questSeen 1. Elsewhere (no
# section 1: xi.moghouse.inMogHouseInHomeNation is false outside the char's nation): available: the menu;
# accepted (a GM), 30014. Then the
# trade: 30015, finished: Prog 1, the Timer; the Timer 0 and questSeen 0 (GMs): 30016, finished: completed;
# available again and the bed placed again (GMs) for the next zone. XI.Verify.Quests oa g9 zones checks the
# zone list itself.
